  "title": "为什么用了 AI，还是没多赚到钱？",
  "transcript_quality": "source-unverified",
  "transcript_source_kind": "local-caption-copy",
  "units": [
    {
      "end_seconds": 2.7199999999999998,
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 0.24,
      "text": "我最近有一些\n挺痛苦的蜕变"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 4.0,
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "然后通过这些蜕变"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 6.08,
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "我又进一步的想清楚了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 7.84,
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "为什么很多人用AI"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 9.92,
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "不能帮自己真的多赚到钱"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 12.0,
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 10.64,
      "text": "我之前从道理上好像懂了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 13.2,
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 12.16,
      "text": "我还专门出了视频去讲"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 14.64,
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "然后我跟很多企业\n去讲的时候"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 15.52,
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "他们也觉得很有道理"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 17.36,
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 15.92,
      "text": "这个道理就是大概第一"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 18.88,
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 17.36,
      "text": "大家其实不是真的会用AI"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 20.0,
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 18.88,
      "text": "如果你真的会用AI的话"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 21.36,
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 20.32,
      "text": "会发现有很多提升的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 23.68,
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 21.76,
      "text": "第二呢就是\n你得先有一个业务对吧"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 24.64,
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 23.68,
      "text": "然后你这个业务本身"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 25.68,
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 24.64,
      "text": "是可以被AI提高的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 28.0,
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 26.08,
      "text": "这个是一个\n古老的theory"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 29.68,
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 28.08,
      "text": "叫做theory of\nconstraint（TOC）"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 31.44,
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 30.56,
      "text": "大概意思就是说"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 35.76,
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 31.84,
      "text": "你要去找到\n你这个业务的约束条件"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 38.16,
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 36.24,
      "text": "你要去在\n那个约束条件上去推进"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 39.36,
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 38.48,
      "text": "不然的话你在别的地方"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 40.64,
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 39.36,
      "text": "去推进再多是没有用的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 43.04,
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 41.12,
      "text": "然后你要找到\n这个约束条件"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 44.0,
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 43.04,
      "text": "用AI去做才有用"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 45.28,
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 44.48,
      "text": "然后还有比如说"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 46.4,
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 45.36,
      "text": "AI在交接的时候"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 48.88,
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 46.4,
      "text": "就很容易把这个提效呢\n变没有"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 50.72,
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 48.96,
      "text": "因为交接的大家\n是没有效率的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 52.56,
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 51.52,
      "text": "可我最近发现啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 55.68,
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 52.64,
      "text": "就是我其实一直\n有一个我的约束"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 57.28,
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 56.08,
      "text": "就是我讲不清楚"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 58.48,
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 57.28,
      "text": "我的课到底在讲什么"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 59.76,
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 58.72,
      "text": "我的课里边好多内容"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 61.76,
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 60.24,
      "text": "每次我想去简单的去讲"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 63.68,
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 61.76,
      "text": "我的课到底\n是讲什么的时候"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 65.44,
      "id": "cue-37",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 64.24,
      "text": "我就卡住"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 66.72,
      "id": "cue-38",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 65.84,
      "text": "这个卡住的原因"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 68.64,
      "id": "cue-39",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 66.72,
      "text": "是因为我怕我说什么"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 70.56,
      "id": "cue-40",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 68.96,
      "text": "都对不起我那个课的内容"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 71.847,
      "id": "cue-41",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 71.047,
      "text": "但这就是个问题"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 72.487,
      "id": "cue-42",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 71.847,
      "text": "这个问题就是"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 75.367,
      "id": "cue-43",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 73.127,
      "text": "我如果没有办法\n让让别人听十秒钟"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 77.687,
      "id": "cue-44",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 75.367,
      "text": "那我怎么让别人有兴趣\n去听一分钟呢"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 79.127,
      "id": "cue-45",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 78.167,
      "text": "我一直知道这个问题"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 80.327,
      "id": "cue-46",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 79.287,
      "text": "但是我解决不了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 81.447,
      "id": "cue-47",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 80.647,
      "text": "所以过去两年呢"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 83.287,
      "id": "cue-48",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 81.447,
      "text": "我都是在做\n各种各样其他的事情"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 85.207,
      "id": "cue-49",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 83.847,
      "text": "从来没有真的\n解决那个问题"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 89.687,
      "id": "cue-50",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 85.927,
      "text": "直到我尝试了一下\n一次线下的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 92.407,
      "id": "cue-51",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 89.847,
      "text": "就是我在一个\n中国人超市前面"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 93.287,
      "id": "cue-52",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 92.487,
      "text": "摆了一个数字大屏"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 94.647,
      "id": "cue-53",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 93.847,
      "text": "我专门写了一个"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 96.247,
      "id": "cue-54",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 94.807,
      "text": "就是打磨了好几次"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 97.287,
      "id": "cue-55",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 96.567,
      "text": "做了一个数字大屏"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 98.727,
      "id": "cue-56",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 97.367,
      "text": "那个超市人流很多"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 100.647,
      "id": "cue-57",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 98.807,
      "text": "然后因为是在\n西雅图这个地方嘛"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 102.327,
      "id": "cue-58",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 100.967,
      "text": "应该很多人\n都是我的潜在学员"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 104.647,
      "id": "cue-59",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 103.447,
      "text": "我这次放了一个\ntracking上去"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 107.207,
      "id": "cue-60",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 105.207,
      "text": "结果发现在那\n放了一个月的大屏"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 109.207,
      "id": "cue-61",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
